    <string name="tour_tab_guia_d">Tap the "Guide" tab in the bottom bar: that\'s where each day is seen and organized.</string>
    <string name="tour_tab_familia_t">Open Family</string>
    <string name="tour_tab_familia_d">Tap the "Family" tab in the bottom bar: that\'s where each caregiver\'s availability is set.</string>
    <string name="tour_tab_semana_t">Open Week</string>
    <string name="tour_tab_semana_d">Tap the "Week" tab in the bottom bar: it\'s the main screen, with the week at a glance.</string>
    <string name="tour_tab_menu_t">Open Menu</string>
    <string name="tour_tab_menu_d">Tap the "Menu" tab in the bottom bar: that\'s where meals are planned.</string>
    <string name="tour_tab_compra_t">Open Shopping</string>
    <string name="tour_tab_compra_d">Tap the "Shopping" tab in the bottom bar: that\'s where the shopping list is.</string>
    <string name="tour_ninos_t">Add the children</string>
    <string name="tour_ninos_d">Start by adding each child with this button. Everything else — activities, pick-ups, alerts — is organized around them.</string>
    <string name="tour_cuid_t">Add the caregivers</string>
    <string name="tour_cuid_d">Add everyone who looks after the children: you, your partner, the grandparents, the babysitter… You can also create family units, like \'the grandparents\'.</string>
    <string name="tour_vinc_t">Link yourself to your caregiver</string>
    <string name="tour_vinc_d">If you are one of them, use the person icon next to your name to link your own account to your caregiver. That way the app knows your schedule and your alerts.</string>
    <string name="tour_inv_t">Invite the caregivers</string>
    <string name="tour_inv_d">This button generates a one-time code. Pick the caregiver you added earlier and send them the code the app generates (by message, for example). When they enter it on their phone with their own account, they join the family and see what you see.</string>
    <string name="tour_guia_nueva_t">Create the children\'s activities</string>
    <string name="tour_guia_nueva_d">Tap + to create an activity: what it is, what time, who drops off and who picks up, how early you want the alert and which days it repeats.</string>
    <string name="tour_guia_linea_t">The day guide</string>
    <string name="tour_guia_linea_d">Here you see the day hour by hour. Green: covered. Red: someone is missing. The circles with initials show who is in charge of each stretch.</string>
    <string name="tour_fam_disp_t">Caregivers\' availability</string>
    <string name="tour_fam_disp_d">Each line is a caregiver and each cell a day. Tap a cell to mark whether they work, have a doctor\'s appointment or are away. The app warns you if an activity is left with nobody.</string>
    <string name="tour_fam_cat_t">Your availability types</string>
    <string name="tour_fam_cat_d">With the pencil you edit the types (work, doctor, trip…) or create new ones.</string>
    <string name="tour_menu_t">The week\'s menu</string>
    <string name="tour_menu_d">Each card is a day. Tap lunch or dinner to write what\'s on the menu: it saves itself and the whole family sees it.</string>
    <string name="tour_compra_t">The shopping list</string>
    <string name="tour_compra_d">Tap here to add what\'s missing at home and choose its store. The list is shared: everyone sees it.</string>
    <string name="tour_menu_sem_t">Change week</string>
    <string name="tour_menu_sem_d">Use the arrows to go to the previous or next week, and tap the date to open the calendar and jump to another one.</string>
    <string name="tour_compra_tienda_t">By store</string>
    <string name="tour_compra_tienda_d">Items are grouped by store. Tick each one when you buy it, and tap a store\'s header to fold or unfold it.</string>
